 "title": "30 V N-channel NexFET power MOSFET, 2 mm × 2 mm SON",
 "source": {
  "revision": "SLPS260E, revised September 2015",
  "pages": 12
 },
 "summary": "A single N-channel power MOSFET in a 2 mm by 2 mm six-lead SON with two exposed pads, aimed at 5 V gate drive in DC-DC conversion and battery or load management. It blocks 30 V; on-resistance is 32 mΩ max with 4.5 V on the gate and 42 mΩ max at 3 V, and total gate charge is 2.1 nC typical. Continuous current is 5 A where the package sets the limit, 19 A for the silicon at a 25 °C case. Lead-free, RoHS compliant and halogen-free.",
 "key_figures": [
